@furryfrog9520 I don't use the price of gas as a factor in choosing where to live, but do you?
and.. I'm being conservative with my expectations... but.. things like freedom of expression, public safety, the low level of corruption... might be.. just might be more important than the price of gas... I still haven't seen anywhere that people are scrambling to immigrate to russia or iran... 
Personally, I'd rather keep paying higher taxes and living in Canada, it is my personal choice...  and I wish good luck to anyone who thinks russia or iran will be better once they start living there...
